    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the silence feels more like a void than anything else. it's just cold. i feel like i'm already a ghost, Elara. i’m just waiting for my body to catch up to how dead i already feel inside. how am i supposed to just \"breathe\" when there's nothing left to breathe for? everything is just so heavy.",
